#: activitypage.cpp:76
msgid ""
"The activity service is running with bare functionalities.\n"
"Names and icons of the activities might not be available."
msgstr ""
"Ta executándose'l serviciu d'actividaes con poques funcionalidaes.\n"
"Quiciabes nun tean disponibles los nomes ya iconos d'actividaes"

#: activitypage.cpp:146
msgid ""
"The activity service is not running.\n"
"It is necessary to have the activity manager running to configure activity-"
"specific power management behavior."
msgstr ""
"Nun ta executándose'l serviciu d'actividaes.\n"
"Ye necesario tener n'execución el xestor d'activides pa configurar el "
"comportamientu de xestión d'enerxía específicu per actividá."

#: activitypage.cpp:239
msgid ""
"The Power Management Service appears not to be running.\n"
"This can be solved by starting or scheduling it inside \"Startup and Shutdown"
"\""
msgstr ""
"El serviciu de xestión d'enerxía paez nun tar executándose.\n"
"Esto pue iguase aniciándolu o programándolu dientro d'«Aniciu y apagáu»"

